@web_api_root_url = https://localhost:5001


### Register a new customer
POST {{web_api_root_url}}/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "SSN": "241019681234",
  "Name": "Giovanni",
  "InitialAmount": 1000
}

### Get Customer details
GET {{web_api_root_url}}/api/v1/customers/3bba27e0-dc6d-4a77-b0a6-2371b08c493d
Content-Type: application/json


### Get list of users
GET {{web_api_root_url}}/users?page=1


